    narr:narration """The architecture stratum is currently defined by the formal adoption of Zypherion for the analytics pipeline, a decision articulated by Quinton Fairweather on August 12, 2026. The [adoption announcement](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1) establishes the technical pivot, which is subsequently [codified in summary documentation](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4). This shift is coupled with a [defined migration timeline](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3) slated for the upcoming quarter, a commitment [formalized as a project milestone](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_6). The broader narrative context [frames these actions](narr:Narrative_ToolAdoptionDecisions) as a deliberate move toward new platform infrastructure, balancing the openness required for technical change with the conservationist pressure inherent in setting firm migration deadlines.""" ;
